# P12 on WinUI: the two of its three subjects a click can reach, in the order
# of actions/mac/P12-tabs-margins-and-toggles.actions (see that file for why
# each click is there). Added 2026-11-15 so CI replays P12 on Windows too.
#
# #580 (state across rotation): no rotation here, so the tab and the counter
# must simply hold -- final capture shows "Selected tab: Second", "counter: 2".
# #632 (margins): read off the capture; the two buttons are pressed anyway.
# #544 (toggle state): after "Set opposite" the forced-on and forced-off
# toggles must look different.
#
# Coordinates are frame DIPs, measured 2026-11-15 from a 125% capture of the
# window placed at (32, 32): x = (capture px + 8 px left border) / 1.25,
# y = capture px / 1.25 (p12-measure-20261115-124039.png).
#
# P12 於 WinUI:三個主題中點擊能觸及的兩個，順序與 actions/mac/P12-tabs-margins-and-toggles.actions 相同(每一下的理由見
# 該檔)。2026-11-15 加入，讓 CI 在 Windows 上也重放 P12。#580:這裡沒有旋轉，分頁與計數器只要保得住——最終擷圖顯示
# 「Selected tab: Second」、「counter: 2」。#632:從擷圖讀；兩顆按鈕仍要按。#544:按「Set opposite」之後，強制開與強制關的
# toggle 必須看起來不同。座標是外框 DIP,2026-11-15 由視窗置於 (32, 32) 的 125% 截圖量得:x = (截圖 px + 左邊框 8 px) / 1.25,
# y = 截圖 px / 1.25(p12-measure-20261115-124039.png)。
